<doc id="96566" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=96566" title="Wes Craven">
Wes Craven

Wesley Earl "Wes" Craven (#ALIH) inggih punika tiyang pènyèrat lan sutradara Amérika, dipuntèpang amargi kathah ndamèl filem-filem horor.
<h2>Biografi</h2>
Biografi.
Craven dipunlahiraken ing Cleveland, Ohio, putra saking Caroline lan Paul Craven. Lajeng dipunsegera dipunbaptis sasampunipun mbabar. Craven lulus saking Jurusan &lt;a href="Basa%20Inggris"&gt;Basa Inggris&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Psikologi"&gt;Psikologi&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Wheaton%20College"&gt;Wheaton College&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Illinois"&gt;Illinois&lt;/a&gt;. Craven kawiwitan merdamel ing indhustri filem minangka èditor suantèn ing sebuah perusahaan pos-produksi ing &lt;a href="New%20York"&gt;New York&lt;/a&gt;. Piyambakipun ugi naté mendhet Jurusan Basa Inggris ing &lt;a href="Westminter%20College"&gt;Westminter College&lt;/a&gt;, Pennsylvania lan profésor ing Clarkson College ing Postdam, New York.
<h2>Karier Nyerat lan Sutradara</h2>
Karier Nyerat lan Sutradara.
Karya Craben dipunanggep dados pengeksploitasian kasunyatan. &lt;a href="A%20Nightmare%20on%20Elm%20Street"&gt;A Nightmare on Elm Street&lt;/a&gt; tuladhanipun, filem punika gadhah daya nginversiaken mimpi ing salebeting kauripan nyawa. &lt;a href="Wes%20Craven%27s%20New%20Nightmare"&gt;New Nightmare&lt;/a&gt; ugi nampilaken ing pundhi sang aktris filem A Nightmare on Elm Street, Heather Langenkamp ing donya nyata berperan dados piyambakipun nglawan penjahat ingkang sajatosipun fiktif. Ing filem punika, kita saged nemuaken pinten-pinten pakulinan seratan skenario Craven ingkang boten naté dipunungkapaken sadèrèngipun purna. &lt;a href="The%20Serpent%20and%20the%20Rainbow%20%28filem%29"&gt;The Serpent of the Rainbow&lt;/a&gt; nyariosaken babagan priya ingkang boten saged bèntenaken ala lan kasunyatan. Film &lt;a href="Scream%20%28filem%29"&gt;Scream (filem)&lt;/a&gt;, karakter-karakteripun berkali-kali mereferensikan filem-filem horor ingkang asring sami kaliyan kahananipun. Konsep punika dipunlajengaken lan bertahan ngantos sekuelipun.
Craven ugi asring berkolaborasi kaliyan &lt;a href="Sean%20S.%20Cunningham"&gt;Sean S. Cunningham&lt;/a&gt; ing filemografi. Ing filem kawiwitan Craven, &lt;a href="The%20Last%20House%20on%20the%20Left%20%28filem%201972%29"&gt;The Last House on the Left&lt;/a&gt; Cunningham linggih minangka prodhuser. Lajeng ing filem Craven ingkang paling dipuntepang, &lt;a href="A%20Nightmare%20on%20Elm%20Street"&gt;A Nightmare on Elm Street&lt;/a&gt;, Cunningham nyutradarai salah satunggaling adegan kejar-kejaran, utawi boten dipunkredit. Kalihkarakter punika, &lt;a href="Freddy%20Krueger"&gt;Freddy Krueger&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Jason%20Voorhees"&gt;Jason Voorhees&lt;/a&gt; tampil sami kaliyan ing filem slasher taun 2003 &lt;a href="Freddy%20vs.%20Jason"&gt;Freddy vs. Jason&lt;/a&gt; kaliyan posisi Cunningham minangka prodhuser lan penyerat skenario filem &lt;a href="Friday%20the%2013th%20%28filem%201980%29"&gt;Friday the 13th&lt;/a&gt;), Victor Miller, dipunkredit minangka ndamel karakter. Lajeng ing filem remake &lt;a href="The%20Last%20House%20on%20the%20Left%20%282009%20filem%29"&gt;The Last House on the Left&lt;/a&gt;, Craven lan Cunningham sami-sami linggih minangka prodhuser. Lewat Twitteripun, Craven wicanten badhé ndamel sekuel Scream ingkang kaping sekawan.
<h3>Pangaji-aji lan Nominasi</h3>
Pangaji-aji lan Nominasi.
Ngantos karieripun, Craven nampi sanga pangaji-aji filem lan tiga nominasi
Ing taun &lt;a href="1977"&gt;1977&lt;/a&gt;, piyambakipun memenangaken 'Prize of the International Critics' Jury' ing "Sitges - Catalonian International Film Festival" kanggé filemipun&lt;a href="The%20Hills%20Have%20Eyes"&gt;The Hills Have Eyes&lt;/a&gt;.
Ing taun 1985, filem horor &lt;a href="A%20Nightmare%20on%20Elm%20Street"&gt;A Nightmare on Elm Street&lt;/a&gt; menangaken 'Critic's Award' ing "Avoriaz Fantastic Film Festival".
Ing taun 1992, Brussels International Festival of Fantasy Film maringi Pegasus Audience Award untuk thriller &lt;a href="The%20People%20Under%20the%20Stairs"&gt;The People Under the Stairs&lt;/a&gt;. Fantasportonipun menangaken International Fantasy Film Award untuk Skenario Terbaik sawatara Best Film Award ditujukan kanggé &lt;a href="New%20Nightmare"&gt;New Nightmare&lt;/a&gt;, filem kapungkasan A Nightmare on Elm Street. Piyambakipun ugi dinominasiaken kanggé Best Film kanggé filemipun &lt;a href="Shocker%20%28filem%29"&gt;Shocker&lt;/a&gt; ing taun 1990.
Gérardmer Film Festival maringi Grand Prize di '97, kanggé filemipun &lt;a href="Scream%20%28filem%29"&gt;Scream&lt;/a&gt;.
Piyambakipun dinominasiaken minangka Best Director kanggé &lt;a href="Scream%20%28filem%29"&gt;Scream&lt;/a&gt; ing AMPAS, USA, taun 1997.
Ing taun 2006, piyambakipun dipunparingake déning Spike TV's &lt;a href="Scream%20Awards"&gt;Scream&lt;/a&gt; ya iku Mastermind Award. Pangaji-aji punika dipunserahaken dateng &lt;a href="Neve%20Campbell"&gt;Neve Campbell&lt;/a&gt;.
