<doc id="96740" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=96740" title="Wassily Leontief">
Wassily Leontief

Wassily Leontief (miyos wonten ing &lt;a href="M%C3%BCnchen"&gt;München&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bayern"&gt;Bayern&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="5"&gt;5&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Agustus"&gt;Agustus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1905"&gt;1905&lt;/a&gt;) inggih punika salah satunggaling &lt;a href="%C3%A9konom"&gt;ékonom&lt;/a&gt; ingkang misuwur amargi panaliténipun babagan kados pundi éwahan wonten ing satunggal &lt;a href="sektor%20%C3%A9konomi"&gt;sektor ékonomi&lt;/a&gt; saged maringi prabawa dhateng sektor sanèsipun. Leontief menangaken Bebungah Nobel Ékonomi nalika taun &lt;a href="1973"&gt;1973&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Pagesangan awal</h2>
Pagesangan awal.
Wassily Leontief, putra saking Wassily W. Leontief (guru besar &lt;a href="%C3%A9konomi"&gt;ékonomi&lt;/a&gt;) lan Eugenia, mlebet ing &lt;a href="Universitas%20Leningrad"&gt;Universitas Leningrad&lt;/a&gt; (sapunika wonten ing St. Petersburg) nalika taun &lt;a href="1921"&gt;1921&lt;/a&gt;. Piyambakipun pikantuk gelar ékonom terpelajar (sami kaliyan &lt;a href="Master%20of%20Arts"&gt;Master of Arts&lt;/a&gt;) nalika taun &lt;a href="1925"&gt;1925&lt;/a&gt; nalika yuswanipun nembé 19 taun.
<h2>Pagesangan Profesional awal</h2>
Pagesangan Profesional awal.
Wiwit taun &lt;a href="1927"&gt;1927&lt;/a&gt; dumugi taun &lt;a href="1930"&gt;1930&lt;/a&gt;, piyambakipun makarya wonten ing Institut Ékonomi Dunia wonten ing &lt;a href="Universitas%20Kiel"&gt;Universitas Kiel&lt;/a&gt;. Ing mrika piyambakipun nliti turunan kurva permintaan lan penawaran statistik. Rikala taun &lt;a href="1929"&gt;1929&lt;/a&gt; piyambakipun mlampah dhateng &lt;a href="Tiongkok"&gt;Tiongkok&lt;/a&gt; saperlu mbiyantu Kementerian Perkeretaapian minangka penasihat.
Nalika taun &lt;a href="1931"&gt;1931&lt;/a&gt;, piyambakipun pindhah dhateng &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, lan makarya wonten ing &lt;a href="National%20Bureau%20of%20Economic%20Research"&gt;National Bureau of Economic Research&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Palakrama lan afiliasi kaliyan Harvard</h2>
Palakrama lan afiliasi kaliyan Harvard.
Nalika taun &lt;a href="1932"&gt;1932&lt;/a&gt;, Leontief palakrrama kaliyan penyair, &lt;a href="Estelle%20Marks"&gt;Estelle Marks&lt;/a&gt;, lan dipunparingi satunggal putra ingkang miyos taun &lt;a href="1936"&gt;1936&lt;/a&gt;, Svetlana Leontief Alpers.
Wonten ing taun &lt;a href="1932"&gt;1932&lt;/a&gt; piyambakipun makarya wonten ing &lt;a href="Harvard%20University"&gt;Harvard University&lt;/a&gt;, wonten ing Jurusan Ékonomi lan nalika taun &lt;a href="1946"&gt;1946&lt;/a&gt; piyambakipun dados &lt;a href="profesor"&gt;profesor&lt;/a&gt; ngèlmu ékonomi.
Leontief ngrantam &lt;a href="Harvard%20Economic%20Research%20Project"&gt;Harvard Economic Research Project&lt;/a&gt; nalika taun &lt;a href="1948"&gt;1948&lt;/a&gt; lan tetep dados &lt;a href="direktur"&gt;direktur&lt;/a&gt; dumugi taun &lt;a href="1973"&gt;1973&lt;/a&gt;. Kawiwitan taun &lt;a href="1965"&gt;1965&lt;/a&gt;, piyambakipun mandégani &lt;a href="Harvard%20Society%20of%20Fellows"&gt;Harvard Society of Fellows&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Séda</h2>
Séda.
Leontief tilar donya wonten ing &lt;a href="New%20York%20City"&gt;New York City&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="New%20York"&gt;New York&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, rikala dinten Jumat, &lt;a href="5"&gt;5&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="F%C3%A8bruari"&gt;Fèbruari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1999"&gt;1999&lt;/a&gt; wonten ing yuswa 93.
